llama-cpp (MIT) binds ggml-org/llama.cpp (MIT) via libllamastack.

include/llama-stack.h is our ABI, implemented in native/llama-stack.c.
Overlay libllama / libggml*: MIT.
https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/blob/master/LICENSE

Published linux/amd64 and windows/amd64 overlays also stage NVIDIA CUDA
user-mode libraries (cudart / cublas / cublasLt). Those binaries are NVIDIA
CUDA Toolkit redistributables, not MIT. The NVIDIA driver (libcuda / nvcuda)
and Vulkan ICDs are never shipped.

See include/PROVENANCE.md.
